Opt-in tool-call diagnostics for the TensorFold 0.6.5 CUDA server.
The decorator is mounted by flash-2/start.sh only with TOOL_TRACE=1.
It records requests, generated tokens/text, emitted deltas and final parsing
without changing parser decisions. Verified by tools/test_tool_calls.py.

